@startuml
title Order fulfilment across named swimlanes
|#lightblue|customer|Customer
start
:Submit order;
|#honeydew|store|Store
partition Fulfilment #ivory {
  :Validate order;
  :Reserve inventory;
}
|customer|
:Receive confirmation;
note right
  Returning to customer reuses the same lane.
end note
|#aliceblue|store|Fulfilment team
:Dispatch order;
|customer|
:Receive parcel;
stop
@enduml
